{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50165","headline":"奉天田明府席饯别 · 胡皓","name":"奉天田明府席饯别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"属城富才雄，文园饯席同。\n此席何所饯？徭役五原中。\n疾沙乱飞雪，连车条转蓬。\n雁归寒塞近，客散祖亭空。\n日夕不遑次，萧条鸣朔风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}